        "worked_solution": "The power set of $C,$ denoted $P(C),$ is the set that contains every possible subset of $C,$ including the empty set $\u2205.$\n\nSo, let's list all possible subsets of $C$ using a tree diagram.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14095809/assets/2f7eed3dea71ea1492e2c9762c39b4292c9fd275b3c6a18832b04454f78dc114.png)\n\nAccording to our diagram, the subsets of $C$ are\n\n$$\n\u2205={},\\,{{2}},\\,{3},\\,{{2},3}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\nP(X)={\u2205,{{2}},{3},{{2},3}}.\n$$",
